   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formation",
     "texto": [
      "It is formed with the present subjunctive of **avoir** or **être** + past participle: **que j'aie fini** (that I have finished), **que tu sois venu** (that you have come).",
      "With **être** the past participle agrees with the subject: **que tu sois venue** (if you are a woman)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "When it is used",
     "texto": [
      "When the action is earlier than the moment we speak about, and it takes the subjunctive: **Je suis content que tu aies réussi ton examen** (I'm glad that you passed your exam)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
